<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman cuts Eurobike.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman cuts Eurobike.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>German motorbike wholesaler Eurobike AG, which was floated on the Frankfurt bourse in June, was cut to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market outperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
